Implement user story epam-ts-004: Fix object cache key collision — toString() produces identical keys

## Story Description
The memoize function in src/cache.ts generates cache keys using String(arg), which collapses all plain objects to '[object Object]'. This causes cache collisions — different arguments overwrite each other's cached results. Fix the key generation so distinct arguments produce distinct keys. The source file(s) are in /tmp/epam-bench-epam-ts-004-aYl0pk/src/. Do not modify the test files.

